Subject: Select original static specular detail blend material and lights
Upstream-base: 11c0bc65ad2ec21431c5d74f1ac4cbc1e3e2e2c3

Keep the original eight-stage TEV recipe and diffuse/specular/shadow calls.
Use Aurora headers, bounded native float arrays and typed FIFO calls, reset
registry instances and the per-activation light cache, and obtain the explicit
native view. Select the original specular-light routines alongside diffuse
lighting with checked inputs and the now source-linked constants and light IDs. Preserve
the original slot-6 lighting mask; zero active lights must not reuse stale state.
The console branches retain their formats and FIFO access. Complete stadium
loading, other material programs and Wii presentation parity remain separate.

